  "_description": "Label-aware auto grouping (ADR-021). Nine cluster-A routable workers on nine BMs (three per AG): three carry dedicated=AAA, three dedicated=BBB, three no label. With config.auto_group_labels=[\"dedicated\"] the auto anti-affinity and auto max-per-BM rules group by (cluster, ip_type, role, dedicated value): three groups of three, each spread one-per-AG (cap ceil(3/3)=1) and one-per-BM. Drop auto_group_labels and the nine form ONE group whose per-AG cap is ceil(9/3)=3 \u2014 all three AAA VMs may then land in the same AG, which is the HA gap this feature closes.",
